{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20500","headline":"和李仆射西园 · 张籍","name":"和李仆射西园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遇午归闲处，西庭敞四檐。\n高眠着琴枕，散帖检书签。\n印在休通客，山晴好卷帘。\n竹凉蝇少到，藤暗蝶争潜。\n晓鹊频惊喜，疎蝉不许拈。\n石苔生紫点，栏药吐红尖。\n虚坐诗情远，幽探道侣兼。\n所营尚胜地，虽俭复谁嫌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20500.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20500","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}